---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | EV Kelly Calculator"
  description="Read our privacy policy regarding data collection, cookies, Google Analytics, and AdSense tracking."
>
  <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto w-full min-h-screen px-4 py-12 md:py-20 flex flex-col">
    
    <header class="flex flex-col items-center text-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <h1 class="animate-reveal text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-[var(--theme-text-main)] mb-4" style="opacity: 0;">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="animate-reveal delay-100 text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] font-medium" style="opacity: 0;">
        Effective Date: July 4, 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="liquid-panel static-panel w-full p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col gap-8">
      
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          At EV Kelly Calculator ("we", "our", or "us"), we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit our website (evkellycalc.com). By using the website, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          The EV Kelly Calculator is a client-side web application. <strong>We do not collect, store, or transmit your financial data, account balances, or trading parameters.</strong> All calculations are performed locally in your web browser. We do, however, collect standard internet log data and visitor behavior information automatically through third-party analytics services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--theme-accent-blue)] tracking-tight">3. Google AdSense & Advertising Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          We utilize Google AdSense to display advertisements. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads on our site based on your prior visits to our website or other websites.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their browsing history.</li>
          <li>Users may opt-out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-[var(--theme-accent-blue)]">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
          <li>Alternatively, users can opt-out of some third-party vendors' uses of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-[var(--theme-accent-blue)]">www.aboutads.info</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">4. Analytics and Consent (TCF v2.2)</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          We use Google Analytics and Google Tag Manager to monitor web traffic. Information collected includes your IP address, browser type, and interaction metrics. We operate in compliance with the IAB Transparency and Consent Framework (TCF v2.2). You retain full control over your cookie preferences and may adjust or withdraw your consent at any time using the consent management banner provided on our site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">5. Data Rights (GDPR, CCPA, DPDPA)</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          Depending on your jurisdiction—including the European Union (GDPR), California (CCPA), or India (DPDPA 2023)—you have specific rights regarding your personal data. You have the right to request access to, deletion of, or restriction of the processing of any anonymized data we may hold via our analytics partners.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">6. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          If you have any questions or requests regarding your data, please contact us by visiting our <a href="/contact" class="text-white underline hover:text-[var(--theme-accent-blue)]">Contact Page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>